---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="README — Non"
  description="Non's engineering defaults: how I approach testability, API contracts, and code that stays maintainable."
>
  <article>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Readme</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10 font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <section aria-labelledby="me-heading">
        <h2 id="me-heading" class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted mb-4">me</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p>Hi 👋, I'm Non. I'm a Software Engineer focused on resilient systems and scalable architecture.</p>
          <p>With a background in food delivery and freelance marketplaces, I specialize in owning features from design to production. I prioritize robustness and team-wide reliability through high-standard code reviews and pragmatic system design. While I'm proficient in Go, Java, and TypeScript, I believe in choosing the right tool for the job — not the other way around.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section aria-labelledby="defaults-heading">
        <h2 id="defaults-heading" class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted mb-4">engineering defaults</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p>
            I prefer simple, predictable technology that scales. The cost of 'hype' is paid in 3 AM incidents, 
            which is why I optimize for boring, maintainable code. Building for scale doesn't mean premature abstraction; 
            it means observability from day one, writing tests that actually protect the critical path, 
            and designing for the inevitable moment the network or the database fails.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="life-heading">
        <h2 id="life-heading" class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted mb-4">life</h2>
        <p>When I'm not coding, I recharge by playing games, watching movies, and being with the people I love.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- <section aria-labelledby="process-heading">
