        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p>Domain boundaries exist to limit blast radius, not for architectural purity.</p>
          <p>When two services share a database, they share every bug and every schema migration. Treat that as a red flag.</p>
          <p>The right time to enforce a boundary is before it's needed, not after it's been violated ten times.</p>
        </div>
      </section> -->
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
